{"type":"text","timestamp":1770256617064,"sessionID":"ses_3d47cb6e6ffeQbeEREbKk78y6V","part":{"id":"prt_c2b843f7d0018j5WRfmYIWae8e","sessionID":"ses_3d47cb6e6ffeQbeEREbKk78y6V","messageID":"msg_c2b84336d001IKGz3jSWAv74hA","type":"text","text":"I have created the Server Action and the accompanying page component.\n\nThe key to refreshing the current page without a redirect in Next.js Server Actions is `revalidatePath`. This purges the cache for the specified route, causing the server component to re-render with fresh data on the next visit or immediate update.\n\n### 1. The Server Action (`app/actions.ts`)\nThis file defines the action. Notice the `'use server'` directive and the use of `revalidatePath('/')`.\n\n```typescript\n'use server'\n\nimport { revalidatePath } from 'next/cache'\n\n// Mock database state for demonstration\nlet notificationsEnabled = false\n\nexport async function getNotificationStatus() {\n  return notificationsEnabled\n}\n\nexport async function toggleNotifications() {\n  // 1. Perform the mutation (e.g., update database)\n  notificationsEnabled = !notificationsEnabled\n\n  // 2. Refresh the current page by revalidating its path\n  // This updates the UI without a browser refresh or redirect\n  revalidatePath('/')\n}\n```\n\n### 2. The Page Component (`app/page.tsx`)\nThis Server Component fetches the initial state and uses a standard HTML `<form>` to invoke the action.\n\n```typescript\nimport { toggleNotifications, getNotificationStatus } from './actions'\n\nexport default async function Page() {\n  // Fetch current data from the server\n  const isEnabled = await getNotificationStatus()\n\n  return (\n    <main className=\"p-4\">\n      <h1 className=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Settings</h1>\n      \n      <div className=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <p>Notifications are currently: <strong>{isEnabled ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}</strong></p>\n        \n        {/* Invoking the server action via the form action prop */}\n        <form action={toggleNotifications}>\n          <button \n            type=\"submit\"\n            className=\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-blue-600\"\n          >\n            Toggle Preference\n          </button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n  )\n}\n```","time":{"start":1770256617064,"end":1770256617064},"metadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}}
